# Scratch output from propose_renames.py — regenerated into the current
# working directory on every run, reviewed by hand, then consumed by
# apply_renames.py. Not rename_log.csv, which IS the permanent record of
# what was actually renamed and belongs in git.
rename_proposals.csv

# Scratch output from build_equipment_manifest.py — same pattern as
# rename_proposals.csv above: regenerated fresh on every run, reviewed by
# hand, not a permanent record worth tracking in git. A reviewed copy
# meant to be a permanent per-vessel record belongs in docs/ instead (see
# docs/vessel_onboarding_guide.md's documented naming convention,
# docs/equipment_manifest_[vesselname].csv) — a deliberate, separate step,
# not this default scratch output.
equipment_manifest_gap_report.csv

